WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:15.251
The monsters drag the kids outside.

2
00:00:15.252 --> 00:00:23.470
They go past cookie houses.

3
00:00:23.471 --> 00:00:26.512
"Help!" Troy cries.

4
00:00:26.513 --> 00:00:30.972
"Monsters have the prince and princess!"

5
00:00:30.973 --> 00:00:39.129
Some people try to help.

6
00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:46.749
The monsters growl and kick them away.

7
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:55.291
"Let go of us!" Jane cries.

8
00:00:55.292 --> 00:00:59.833
The monsters take the kids out of town.

9
00:00:59.834 --> 00:01:03.508
They drop them on the ground.

10
00:01:03.509 --> 00:01:06.499
"Ouch!" Jane says.

11
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:13.618
Pip rubs his brow. "Ow!"

12
00:01:13.619 --> 00:01:20.737
A cage pops up. Click!

13
00:01:20.738 --> 00:01:28.438
Pip frowns. "We're locked in here."

14
00:01:28.439 --> 00:01:38.651
Loud shouts ring out. "Let them go!"

15
00:01:38.652 --> 00:01:44.960
The monsters run to the sound.

16
00:01:44.961 --> 00:01:50.041
"Yay!" Jane says. "The people in town!

17
00:01:50.042 --> 00:01:55.105
They got the monsters away."

18
00:01:55.106 --> 00:02:00.354
"How do we get out?" Pip asks.

19
00:02:00.355 --> 00:02:08.266
"I know!" Jane takes out the wand.

20
00:02:08.267 --> 00:02:15.075
She waves it, but nothing happens.

21
00:02:15.076 --> 00:02:20.887
"Let me try," Pip says.

22
00:02:20.888 --> 00:02:28.109
Pip waves the wand too, but nothing happens.

23
00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:30.931
"Give it back," Jane says.

24
00:02:30.932 --> 00:02:36.516
She grabs the wand, but Pip holds on.

25
00:02:36.517 --> 00:02:42.250
The wand shines. Zap!

26
00:02:42.251 --> 00:02:46.454
The cage fades away.

27
00:02:46.455 --> 00:02:51.916
"Wow!" Pip says. "How did that happen?"

28
00:02:51.917 --> 00:02:55.477
"I don't know," Jane says.

29
00:02:55.478 --> 00:03:03.071
"But we need to go, now!"

